OL,3,GNEWSAChild left with face and body
OL,4,Ainjuries after 'sectarian-motivated'
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is reported one of these males
OL,8,Fpunched the boy in the face, which
OL,9,Fknocked him to the ground before he was
OL,10,Fthen kicked by all three males.
OL,12,FSupt Claire Hamilton described the
OL,13,Fincident as "a deplorable attack on a
OL,14,Fchild", which is being investigated "as
OL,15,Fan assault motivated by sectarian
OL,16,Fhate".
